600	     2	//!
601	     3	//! The methods the service has used, oldest first:
602	     4	//!
603	     5	//! - `did:key` — the identifier is one multibase-encoded Ed25519 key.
604	     6	//! - `did:peer:0` — the same, under the peer method.
605	     7	//! - `did:peer:2` — several keys, each tagged with its purpose, plus service
606	     8	//!   endpoints, all encoded in the identifier.
